    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But you used the word \"hate\" in my question when summarizing it... actually you didn't use it in your response, but you said critics \"argue\" things. If the opposition is mostly just trying to protect public funds so they aren't being rational, isn't the voucher movement basically the only one that actually helps kids? Like, tell me straight, is there any real evidence that vouchers actually help people, or is it just an excuse to defund schools?",
